invalid.js:6:22 lint/nursery/useTanstackQueryStableQueryClient  FIXABLE  ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

  × This QueryClient is created again each time the component renders.
  
    5 │ function Component() {
  > 6 │ 	const queryClient = new QueryClient();
      │ 	                    ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
    7 │ 	return null;
    8 │ }
  
  i Each new client starts with an empty cache, so the data that was already fetched is lost on every render.
  
  i Create the client outside of the component, or store it with useState.
  
  i This rule belongs to the nursery group, which means it is not yet stable and may change in the future. Visit https://biomejs.dev/linter/#nursery for more information.
  
  i Unsafe fix: Store the client with React.useState.
  
    6 │ → const·[queryClient]·=·React.useState(()·=>·new·QueryClient());
      │         +           +   +++++++++++++++++++++                 + 

